            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.32 — Smooth sidebar</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Hiding the sidebar is one motion.</b> The sidebar slides away as the page widens to fill its place, and the top bar glides down in step. Showing it again reverses the same way.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
