            <title>1.1.31</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:05:12 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>43</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.31</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.31 — Press to peek</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Force click a link</b> to see it in a preview that grows out of where you pressed. Shift-click still works too.</li>
<li><b>Site settings.</b> The slider button in the address opens a glass panel for the site you're on: whether it's secure, switches for sound, ad blocking, pop-out video and separate logins, its zoom, and its cookies.</li>
<li><b>A tidier sidebar.</b> The space's name sits under the address, your initials sit at the bottom, and hovering a tab is instant.</li>
<li><b>A new welcome.</b> Meet Pane fills the window, follows light and dark, brings your tabs over from Arc, Chrome, Dia, Helium and more, and shows how a new tab really works.</li>
<li><b>A new icon.</b></li>
</ul>
]]></description>
